# Repomix Ignore Patterns

# Repomix output bundles and archives (prevent recursive self-inclusion)
*repomix*
*repomix*.*
repomix-output.*
repo intel's repomix-output.xml
icenov16-repomix.md
ICE-comparision.md
*.repomix.md
*.repomix.xml
*.repomix.json

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Python cache & compiled files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.pyc

# Test & lint caches
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Environment and sensitive files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Databases & logs
*.log
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# OS metadata & version control
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.git/
